  "description_short": "Family-friendly Portuguese and seafood restaurant with a playground near Victoria Bay.",
  "description_long": "Caspita Restaurant sits just off the N2 at Victoria Heights, a short drive from the beaches of Victoria Bay. This popular family spot serves Portuguese and Italian classics alongside fresh seafood, making it a reliable choice for groups and families exploring the Garden Route. The playground keeps little ones entertained while parents enjoy generous plates of grilled prawns, espetadas, or wood-fired pizzas.\n\nThe atmosphere is casual and welcoming, with both indoor and outdoor seating. It's the kind of place where you can settle in for a relaxed lunch or dinner without fuss. The seafood platter is a crowd favourite, and the Portuguese chicken delivers on flavour. Whether you're breaking up a road trip or meeting friends for a weekend meal, Caspita offers good food and a laid-back vibe that works for everyone.",
